\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S5}{\ignorespaces Comparison of Normalized Risk Scores with Robinson et al. (2018) risk scores (Robinson Risk Score).(A) Relative risk score from the study herein; (B) Related risk score extracted from Robinson et al. (2018) and adapted to the new district subdivision outlines; (C) Scatter plot showing the Spearman correlation between Normalized Risk Score and Robinson Risk Score, with linear regression fit line (red) and 1:1 reference line (black dashed line); D) Horizontal bar plot showing the districts ranked by Robinson Risk Score, with side-by-side comparison of both scoring methods. The analysis includes 63 districts with complete data from both studies.}}{38}{figure.caption.17}\protected@file@percent }
